From b0a8e40d77b47b14d4d2dac422f394ead57e7bbf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "HT9045 Machine (V906)" <Claude_RDBC_02@honprec.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 21:13:33 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] HTDESIGNER-89: Layout > Reset one part (position / size /
 layout / all), like WPF (0.89.0)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

WPF (Working with elements > Reset the element layout): "choose Layout >
Reset PropertyName ... (or choose Layout > Reset All ...)". The right-click
版面重設 always reset everything that differs from the .dfm (the text and the
look too). Now it is a submenu on the design surface and the component tree:
重設位置 (Left / Top), 重設大小 (Width / Height), 重設全部版面 (the four), 全部改回
DFM (as before). cmdResetToDfm(d, only) keeps only the layout rows it names;
one Ctrl+Z as before.

WPF_DIFF_LOG.md: item 14 done (0.88 commit filled in); new open items 15-20
from the XAML Designer keyboard shortcuts page and Blend's resize page
(Ctrl+Shift+A, F9, Alt+arrows, Ctrl+N, Shift keeps the ratio, F2 edits the
text).

Tests (all 4 layers pass: lib 159, smoke 180, panels, real VS Code 154):
smoke (position only = left 54 without the bold, size only = nothing, whole
layout = setLayout only; the submenu on both menus, 全部改回 DFM inside it);
real VS Code (position only: spbSave left back to 54, the bold untouched,
undone).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
